---
import ProtocolLayout from "../layouts/ProtocolLayout.astro";
import LegalArticle from "../components/LegalArticle.astro";
---

<ProtocolLayout
  title="SMS Terms & Conditions | Metabolic Molly · WholeHearted"
  description="Terms for the Metabolic Molly text message program: what you'll receive, how often, and how to opt out."
  index={true}
>
  <LegalArticle heading="SMS Terms & Conditions" updated="November 20, 2026">
    <p>
      These terms apply to the <strong>Metabolic Molly</strong> text message program, run by <strong>WholeHearted</strong>
      (Molly Broad, 1671 Big Bear Dr., Centerville, OH 45458).
    </p>

    <h2>1. Program description</h2>
    <p>
      When you opt in, you'll receive text messages from Metabolic Molly with replies to your questions, reminders,
      metabolic health education tips, invitations to our weekly live Zoom call, product and offer updates, and help
      getting started after you place an order.
    </p>

    <h2>2. How you opt in</h2>
    <p>
      You opt in by sending us your mobile number after we ask for permission to text you in a chat on our website,
      Facebook, Instagram, or TikTok, and after seeing this disclosure: by sharing your number you agree to receive
      recurring texts from Metabolic Molly; message and data rates may apply; reply STOP to opt out. See
      <a href="/sms-opt-in/">how text opt-in works</a>. Consent is not a condition of any purchase.
    </p>

    <h2>3. Message frequency</h2>
    <p>Message frequency varies, up to 8 messages per month, plus replies to messages you send us.</p>

    <h2>4. Cost</h2>
    <p><strong>Message and data rates may apply.</strong> Check your mobile plan for details. We do not charge for texts.</p>

    <h2>5. How to opt out</h2>
    <p>
      Reply <strong>STOP</strong> to any message at any time. You'll receive one final message confirming you've been
      unsubscribed, and you won't receive more texts unless you opt in again. Replies such as END, CANCEL, UNSUBSCRIBE,
      or QUIT also work.
    </p>

    <h2>6. Help</h2>
    <p>
      Reply <strong>HELP</strong> for help, or contact us at
      <a href="mailto:molly@metabolicmolly.com">molly@metabolicmolly.com</a> or <a href="tel:5136506639">(513) 650-6639</a>.
    </p>

    <h2>7. Carriers</h2>
    <p>Mobile carriers are not liable for delayed or undelivered messages.</p>

    <h2>8. Eligibility</h2>
    <p>You must be 18 or older and the account holder of the mobile number, or have the account holder's permission.</p>

    <h2>9. Health information</h2>
    <p>
      Our messages are wellness education and encouragement only. They are not medical advice, and our products are not
      intended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease. Talk with your healthcare provider before starting any
      supplement, especially if you take medication or are pregnant or nursing.
    </p>

    <h2>10. Privacy</h2>
    <p>
      We respect your privacy. Your mobile number and consent are never sold or shared with third parties or affiliates
      for marketing purposes. See our <a href="/privacy/">Privacy Policy</a>.
    </p>

    <h2>11. Changes</h2>
    <p>We may update these terms. The date at the top shows when they last changed.</p>
  </LegalArticle>
</ProtocolLayout>
